== Changes ==
*{{api|t=e|CHAT_MSG_ADDON}} arg4's value for sender now returns player name - realm name instead of just the player name (e.g. "Arthas-Silvermoon")
*{{api|t=e|CHAT_MSG_WHISPER}} arg2's value for author now returns player name - realm name instead of just the player name (e.g. "Arthas-Silvermoon")
* I haven't checked all other CHAT_MSG_* events but its not unlikely they will also include realm names

